---
import Base from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy — Compliance365">
  <Section title="Privacy Policy">
    <div class="card">

      <p>
        Compliance365 Pty Ltd (“Compliance365”, “we”, “us”, “our”) is committed to protecting your
        privacy in accordance with the <strong>Privacy Act 1988 (Cth)</strong> and the
        <strong>Australian Privacy Principles (APPs)</strong>.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        We collect personal information reasonably necessary for our business activities, including:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Contact details such as your name, email address, phone number, and organisation;</li>
        <li>Information you provide through forms, enquiries, or when requesting resources;</li>
        <li>Usage data from our website, including analytics and cookies (for site performance only).</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. Purpose of Collection</h2>
      <p>
        We collect, use, and store personal information for the following purposes:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Responding to enquiries and providing requested information or services;</li>
        <li>Managing client relationships and maintaining business records;</li>
        <li>Sending updates, resources, or event invitations (only with your consent);</li>
        <li>Improving our services, website functionality, and user experience.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. How We Collect Information</h2>
      <p>
        Personal information is collected directly from you through forms, meetings, or correspondence,
        and indirectly through analytics tools (e.g., Google Analytics) or service providers that
        help us operate our website and systems.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Disclosure of Personal Information</h2>
      <p>
        We may disclose personal information to trusted third parties who assist us in providing our
        services, including:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Cloud and IT service providers (e.g., Microsoft, AWS, HubSpot);</li>
        <li>Email, analytics, and web hosting providers;</li>
        <li>Professional advisers and auditors where required by law.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We do not sell, rent, or trade personal information to any third parties.
        Where data is stored offshore (e.g., cloud services), we take reasonable steps to ensure it is
        handled in accordance with the APPs.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Data Security and Storage</h2>
      <p>
        We use secure systems and practices to protect personal information from misuse, interference,
        and unauthorised access, modification, or disclosure. Information is stored in encrypted
        cloud environments with access controls applied.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Access and Correction</h2>
      <p>
        You may request access to, or correction of, your personal information at any time by
        contacting us. We will respond within a reasonable timeframe and may request verification of
        your identity before providing access.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Cookies and Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        Our website may use cookies and similar technologies to enhance usability and collect
        aggregated statistics. You can adjust your browser settings to reject cookies; however, this
        may affect website functionality.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Direct Marketing</h2>
      <p>
        We may send you communications about services or resources that may be of interest.
        You may opt out at any time by clicking “unsubscribe” in an email or by contacting us directly.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        For questions, access requests, or privacy concerns, please contact:
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Compliance365 Pty Ltd</strong><br>
        Email: <a href="mailto:info@compliance365.com.au">info@compliance365.com.au</a><br>
        Website: <a href="https://www.compliance365.com.au">www.compliance365.com.au</a>
      </p>

      <h2>10. Updates to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy may be updated periodically to reflect legislative or operational changes.
        The latest version will always be available on our website.
      </p>

      <p class="muted small">
        Last updated: October 2025
      </p>

    </div>
  </Section>
</Base>
